WEBVTT

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.391
I want to tell you about the last
conversation that I had with Will.

00:16:02.320 --> 00:16:06.360
It was the day that
he was going to be executed,

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:10.096
and we were just talking.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:12.520
There was nothing left to do in his case.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.040
And we were talking about his life.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:19.600
And he was talking first about his dad,
who he hardly knew, who had died,

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:24.800
and then about his mom,
who he did know, who was still alive.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.080
And I said to him,

00:16:28.600 --> 00:16:29.800
"I know the story.